GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=active&sort_by=created_at&order=desc&limit=50&offset=0
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Tasks due within a half-open interval [due_from, due_before)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=active&due_from=2026-10-11T22:00:00Z&due_before=2026-10-18T22:00:00Z&sort_by=due_at&order=asc
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Overdue tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=overdue&sort_by=due_at&order=asc
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Upcoming tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=upcoming&sort_by=due_at&order=asc
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
